    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shekemu kūng'wikūmva Dina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūmò ū Dina ūyo Leya walī wamyalīla Yakobo, ūja kūbagīsha bashīke ba ng'wigūngūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekemu, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Hamoli, ūyo walī nsugi wa Bahīvī, ūmona ū ng'wanikī ng'wenūyo; ūndutanja ūja kūlaala nang'hwe bo nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī ng'holò yakwe yūdimana no nū Dina, ū nshīke wa ng'wa Yakobo. Kwīngīīla henaho, ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo ūntogwa no ū ng'wanikī, būbiza na mahooya gawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Shekemu ūng'wīla ū ise ū Hamoli gīkī, “Nilūngījage baba ū ng'wanikī ng'wenūyū nantoole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūwīlwa gīkī ū nshīke wakwe wasosohajiagwa, gwike a bitūnja bakwe baalī lūgundīīga, badīmaga mitugo; na lūūlū ūhuumūla dūhū kūshisha biza kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise wa ng'wa Shekemu ū Hamoli ūja ū kū ng'wa Yakobo kūhooya nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūkashoka a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo ū kūfuma ū kū madīīmīlo ga mitugo, aho bayiigwa īyo yalī yilonga yenīyo, bakapīnīhala hangī būpelana no. Nguno ū Shekemu akīīta mhayo gwa soni no ū kū Baisilaeli, ū gwa kūlaala na nshīke wa ng'wa Yakobo; mhayo ūyo gūtigelile kwītwa nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Hamoli akabibūūlīla ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū ng'witūnja wane ū Shekemu ī ng'holò yakwe īlī ū kūlī nshīke wing'we gete. Nalīmulomba mung'winhe abize nke wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itooleelagi dūhū na a bise; twinhagi a bashīke bing'we, na a bing'we muyūsola a bashīke bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudūgije ū kwigasha hamò nise ūmu; ī sī yīyī īlī kū būtongi wing'we īmulindile. Zengagi mo, musūlūje na kūpandīkīla mo sabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Shekemu ūng'wīla ū ise wa Dina na a basīzaye, “Nanukūlagi nakūng'winha shose shose īsho mulanilombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipangīlagi ī sabo ja kūkwa, gīt'umo mulabonele, nūūlū na ja nsango",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nsango:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū manong'ho.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūlū jilīho, nakūfunya dūhū; ū mhayo ū ntaale a bing'we ninhagi ū ng'wanikī abize nke wane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo aho bakūhooyaga nū Shekemu hamò nū ise ū Hamoli, batūmamīlaga būlomolomo; nguno ū ilūmbū lyabo ū Dina walī wasosohajiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbawīla, “Tūtūdūla a bise ū kūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo, tūtūdūla kūntooja ū ilūmbū lise kūlī ng'wing'wana atasaalilwe. Ū mhayo gwenūyo ū kū bise gūkūbiza gwa soni no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūkūmuzunīlīja ūlū ng'ūzunya mhayo gūyū, gīkī mubize gīt'umo tūlī a bise; būlī ngosha ū mu bing'we asaalwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho lūūlū hū tūkūyūng'winha a bashīke bise, na a bise tūkūyūbasola a bashīke bing'we. Ūlū ng'wīta gīko tūkūzenga hamò ning'we, tūkūbiza bamò bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū mūtūzunyaga ū kūsaalwa, a bise tūkūnsola ū ilūmbū lise tūje.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bana Shekemu kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwabo gūnona ū kūlī Hamoli nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Shekemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo walī akūjiwe no ū mu kaya ya ng'wa ise; na lūūlū īkī walī wadutwa no nū nshīke wa ng'wa Yakobo, atadīlile wandya kwigeya geya, kwīta ūmo bakahayīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hamoli nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Shekemu būja ū kū mita gwa nzengo, ūko bamanhījaga na a bichaabo, būūkahooya na a banhū ba mu nzengo gwabo. Būbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A banhū benaba batūyegelile no; tūbazunīlījagi dūhū bazenge ū mu sī yise, nī būsūlūja bīīte. Nguno ī sī ngalī noi, īkūbigela dūhū nabo. Na a bashīke babo tūkūyūbatoola, na a boi babatoola a bashīke bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a bagosha bakūzunya ū kwikala ng'wenūmu na kūbiza bamò bise ūlū tūzunya kwīta mhayo gūmò, a bagosha ū mu bise basaalwe babize gīt'umo balī a boi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū mulībona kinehe, ī mitugo jabo jitūbiza jise, nī sabo jabo ī jingī, nī shikolo ī shingī īsho balī nasho? Na lūūlū tūbazunīlījagi ū mhayo ūyo balīgūhaya, bazenge ng'wenūmu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bagosha abo baalī baja ū kū mita bizunīlīja nū Hamoli, hamò nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Shekemu; na ng'hana pye a bagosha ū mu nzengo gwenūyo būsaalwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū idatū, būsangwa bataalī balwaagije, nīyo balīyūsaatwa kībi no, bitūnja babīlī ba ng'wa Yakobo, ba Simioni na Lawī, a basīzaye ba ng'wa Dina, būsola mapanga gabo. Būbasanga ko a banhū benabo mu shībya, būbabūlaga pye a bagosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būmūlaga ū Hamoli nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Shekemu, būng'wīnja ū ilūmbū lyabo ū Dina ū mu numba ya ng'wa Shekemu, būduta bajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo būja ū kū nzengo ūyo banhū baalī baabūlagwa; būūkashisola ī shikolo sha mu nzengo gwenūyo, ūmo ilūmbū lyabo walī wasosohagījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.27",
